  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP - anti corruption in a Covid-19 context</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program will  have a focs on the immediate Covid-19 response and recovery, but also on strengthening transparency, accountability and integrity through effective digital governance to build forward better with resilient institutions and service delivery mechanism.
The main objective is to promote digital governance for transparency, accountability and anti-vorruption to build forward better.</narrative>
  </description>
